+    vLLM, SGLang and llama.cpp all auto-load ``<model_dir>/chat_template.jinja``. A mount at
+    any other container path only reaches the engine through an explicit
+    ``--chat-template`` / ``--chat-template-file``, so THERE the flag is part of the wiring
+    and its removal is a coverage loss."""
